     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 2 = 3</p>\n<p>In base 7: 3</p>\n<p>One’s place: 3</p>\n<p>Carry: No need</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 6 + 4 = 10 = 7 + 3</p>\n<p>In base 7: 13</p>\n<p>This column: 3</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 4 + 1 = 6</p>\n<p>In base 7: 6</p>\n<p>This column: 6</p>\n<p>Carry: You don’t need to carry because there are no more columns.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{633_7}\"></span></p>"
